SystemRequirements: ffmpeg (for video output), LaTeX and dvisvgm (for Tex and
    MathTex), typst (for Typst and MathTypst), Python with Pygments (optional,
    for highlighting every language in Code)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://adamrsophie.github.io/manimR/, https://github.com/adamrsophie/manimR
